## Notes

Today's biggest lesson wasn't about coding.

It was about knowing when to stop fixing something and start over.

Deleting the old Hero wasn't losing progress—it gave me a much better understanding of how everything should be built.

Sometimes rebuilding a feature with a better plan is faster than trying to save a broken one.

Tomorrow's goal is simple:

Finish recreating the Hero layout exactly as I designed it before moving on to animations.